OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre supporters call for
OL,4,Ait to reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FCampaigners calling for a leisure
OL,7,Fcentre which was closed three years ago
OL,8,Fto reopen have staged a protest in
OL,9,FDewsbury.
OL,11,FThe town's sports centre initially
OL,12,Fclosed in 2023 when Raac - reinforced
OL,13,Fautoclaved aerated concrete - was
OL,14,Fdiscovered at the Kirklees Council-run
OL,15,Fsite before closing for good last year.
OL,17,FThe council said earlier this year that
OL,18,F#35m funding for a new centre had been
OL,19,Fsecured, but was still in the planning
OL,20,Fstages.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
