OL,3,GNEWSALeisure centre supporters call for
OL,4,Ait to reopen
OL,5,
OL,6,FSurraya Patel from the campaign said:
OL,7,F"Dewsbury cannot be expected to wait
OL,8,Funtil a future replacement is
OL,9,Fdelivered. We believe the council must
OL,10,Fproperly explore whether repairing and
OL,11,Freopening the existing centre can
OL,12,Fprovide that bridge."
